        "notes": "Round three is where you'll make your first big choice.\n\nIf you're being heavily dive and targeted, take [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c). This is a massive help in your duels because  [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c) effects your own orb as well. Also, consider swapping [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) for  [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) for a little more survivability, if needed.\n\nIf you're going largely uncontested, take [Dual Harmony](item_6484b4c4-294c-410d-ae1d-8049f161df31) instead for better healing output, and better cash scaling.",
