        "notes": "If you didn't take [Dual Harmony](item_6484b4c4-294c-410d-ae1d-8049f161df31) on round 3, it's best to take it here. You'd damage output should be scaling really well by now, and spreading that healing to another teammate is huge.\n\nIf you did take Dual Harmony in round three, then consider taking [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c) now for the same reasons. Otherwise, if you're team is hard flanking, [Gotta Have Faith](item_b1c30cfc-b920-4d1e-91f3-98c16ca0c3d7) could serve you well.\n\nWith three Harmony Orbs on the field, [Teacher's Totem](item_32e3e66c-1fc1-46d0-b3fb-6438a4583c26) gets crazy value. Alternatively, grab [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) for more solo survivability.",
